# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Step-0 git hygiene (2026-10-05). Derived build output only. Zero runtime
# behaviour change; this section records *intent* so future maintainers do not
# re-add generated payloads by accident.
#
# Deliberately NOT ignored, and the reason matters:
#   sites/tinghe-archive/*.py  -> real build/ops source (build_chapter_pages,
#     run_daily_task, run_audit, repair_chapters, verify_originals_batch...).
#     Blanket-ignoring sites/ would discard working ops code. Only the
#     rendered payload under public/ and *.html is derived.
#   research/persona_dna_library/**/*.md -> finalized script sources, not
#     media. Only the multi-GB world_live_watchdog.log is excluded, by the
#     rule above. This corrects an earlier assumption that the whole
#     2.7 GB directory was untracked push risk; it was one ignored log file.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Rendered archive payload, rebuilt by the tracked builders above.
#
# public/ is ignored by its contents, not wholesale. Ignoring the directory
# itself also excluded public/assets/, which is hand-written source: app.css,
# app.js, upgrade.css and the art SVGs. The 2026-10-12 restyle lived only in the
# working tree and in the deployed output — a clean checkout of this repo would
# have produced a site with no stylesheet and no behaviour, and no diff would
# have shown why. The rendered parts (data/, read/, index.html, sitemap.xml)
# stay ignored; they are rebuilt by the tracked builders.
sites/tinghe-archive/public/*
!sites/tinghe-archive/public/assets/
# Cover art under assets/ is generated by the cover builder, not authored.
sites/tinghe-archive/public/assets/originals/
sites/tinghe-archive/public/assets/*.bak-*
sites/tinghe-archive/**/*.html
# Contains deploy account identifiers; never publish.
sites/tinghe-archive/wrangler-account.json

